Third-party works
-----------------

This project contains code and data ported from the following projects, licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 3. The ported parts were translated from C# to Swift and modified
in 2026; docs/DEVELOPMENT.md ("Porting notes") describes the changes.

* DanmakuPlayer — https://github.com/Poker-sang/DanmakuPlayer
  by Poker-sang and contributors.
  Danmaku track allocation (Models/Danmaku.Position.cs), the advanced (mode 7) danmaku model
  and easing (Models/AdvancedDanmaku.cs), Bilibili XML / protobuf field layouts, and its port
  of the pakku.js danmaku combiner and pinyin table.

* pakku.js — https://github.com/xmcp/pakku.js
  by xmcp.
  The similar-danmaku merging algorithm and the pinyin table used for homophone matching,
  ported via DanmakuPlayer.
